# Authors

"The Bazaar Authors" means the people, and the AI agents disclosed as
contributors, who have written parts of Bazaar. It is the copyright holder
named in the LICENSE files and in NOTICE.

Human contributors are listed below by GitHub handle. Contributions from AI
agents are disclosed in the git history through `Co-Authored-By:` trailers,
and each one is sponsored and signed off by a named human. Agents are not
listed here individually.

Initial author:

- @Cookiesmuch (project owner)

To add yourself, include an entry in the pull request that carries your first
change.
